---
/**
 * Material Symbols paths inlined at build time (Apache-2.0).
 *
 * Replaces the iconify-icon CDN web component the old build used: that shipped
 * a render-blocking third-party script and fetched each icon over the network
 * at runtime, so the icons were invisible to anything that doesn't run JS —
 * including every AI crawler. Inline SVG has no request, no JS and no CLS.
 */

